WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A familiar place to return.
Your saved contribution plan, at a glance.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Explore before you add.
Browse identities, then inspect the asset. Market snapshots are not quotes.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Your amount. Your split.
Example mode uses synthetic balances and estimates. Nothing is bought.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Every micro-USDC accounted for.
Open the calculation and inspect the sources behind each line.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
A starting point, never an auto-trade.
Browse community splits. Copying or following never approves a purchase.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Keep the next step close.
Portfolio, Markets, Plan and Community stay within reach on your phone.
